  "_note_classes_c": "T-classes-c: the features that needed the engine to learn a new word. Three ride `requires` predicates combat._requires_met() did not have (a damaged target, an active Rage, the first round); Warding Flare rides a reaction payload that imposes Disadvantage instead of adding AC; Aura of Protection is the first `aura`, which is not a verb anyone presses but a standing fact combat.aura_bonus() reads where a save is rolled."
}
